        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-08-11T01:54:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "making this priority 0 allows to speed up programming, otherwise interrupt latency is not as predictable.\n\nNote that as opposed to the case when this priority was elevated for regular UART drivers here duration of intervals when this interrupt is active is limited to a few bytes sent from the EC.\n\nI did not observe any issues when testing, but if you can suggest a more rigorous test I sure will run it.",
      "parentUuid": "b1d47a22_2e99089b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 108,
        "startChar": 56,
